{
  "name": "biscuit-rust",
  "description": "A comprehensive Rust implementation of the Biscuit authentication and authorization token system, providing a decentralized and offline-delegatable capability framework for microservices. It utilizes a custom Datalog-based logic language to define fine-grained authorization policies and employs public-key cryptography for secure token attenuation and validation. The repository includes a core authentication library, a parser for the Datalog DSL, procedural macros for compile-time token construction, and C-compatible FFI bindings.",
